  {
    "clave": "granja.ayuda",
    "es": "Corral crea corrales y los agranda tocando una celda pegada. Añade varios animales, aliméntalos con tus cosechas, mímalos y ponles juguetes. El que lleva mucho sin comer enferma: cúralo antes de una semana. Limpia cada corral una vez por semana o el ánimo caerá al doble.",
    "en": "Pen creates pens and enlarges them by tapping an adjacent cell. Add several animals, feed them with your harvests, pet them and give them toys. One that goes too long without eating gets sick: heal it within a week. Clean each pen once a week or its mood will drop twice as fast."
  },
